== Trivia ==
* In the Bible, Samson was a supernaturally strong warrior who derived his power from his Nazarite vow, entitling immense strength to Samson if he did not cut his hair.
* Samson first appeared in the ''Binding of Isaac: Wrath of the Lamb'' expansion, where he was unlocked by skipping two {{R|Treasure Room}} items and killing {{E|Mom}} in one run.
** In that version, he had only 1 heart container and a soul heart for his starting health, and his Bloody Lust item acted as a weaker version of Afterbirth's {{I|Lusty Blood}} item.
* Samson's locked icon shows him bound in chains.
** He shares this trait with {{C|Magdalene}}, {{C|Cain}}, {{C|Eve}}, {{C|Lazarus}}, {{C|Bethany|r}}, and {{C|Jacob and Esau|r}}.
* Samson's Bloody Lust item is mistakenly called "Blood Lust" in the character selection screen.
** This is similar to Cain's {{i|Lucky Foot}} item, which is also missing its "y" and is called "Luck Foot" in his character description.

